---
// Prerendered to STATIC HTML on purpose (2026-09-10). This page has no
// per-request data — everything on it is hardcoded. Static output is served
// straight from Cloudflare's edge via the ASSETS binding WITHOUT invoking the
// worker, which is what removes the 20s cold start (see CLAUDE.md).
// If this page is ever wired to the CMS, delete this line so it returns to SSR.
export const prerender = true;
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
	title={'Dr. Chris Duhon, AuD | Liberty Hearing Center'}
	description={'Dr. Chris Duhon, AuD — Doctor of Audiology and founder of Liberty Hearing Center, College Station, TX.'}
	active="about"
	footer="staff"
	ogType="profile"
>
<section style="background:var(--surface-blue)">
<div style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:56px clamp(18px,4vw,32px) 0">
<nav style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:9px 20px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--white);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(var(--navy-rgb),.06)">
<a href="/" style="transition:.3s" style-hover="color:var(--gold)">Home</a><span style="color:var(--text-muted)">/</span>
<a href="/about/" style="transition:.3s" style-hover="color:var(--gold)">About</a><span style="color:var(--text-muted)">/</span>
<span style="color:var(--text-muted)">Dr. Chris Duhon</span>
</nav>
<div style="margin-top:34px;padding-bottom:72px">
<div>
<span style="display:block;margin-bottom:18px;color:var(--brand-red);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase">Our Providers</span>
<h1 style="margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(38px,4.2vw,64px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.045em;text-wrap:balance">Dr. Chris Duhon, AuD</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 26px;max-width:620px;color:var(--text-body);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.45;text-wrap:pretty">Doctor of Audiology | Founder, Liberty Hearing Center | College Station, TX</p>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap">
<a href="/book-appointment/" style="display:inline-flex;min-height:50px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:12px 24px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:999px;background:var(--brand-red);color:var(--white);font-size:14px;font-weight:750;transition:.3s" style-hover="background:var(--navy);transform:translateY(-2px)">Schedule With Dr. Duhon</a>
<a href="tel:9794507996" style="display:inline-flex;min-height:50px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:12px 24px;border:1px solid var(--brand-red);border-radius:999px;background:var(--white);color:var(--brand-red);font-size:14px;font-weight:750;transition:.3s" style-hover="border-color:var(--navy);background:var(--navy);color:var(--white);transform:translateY(-2px)">Call 979-450-7996</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:var(--white)">
<div data-stack="2" style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(46px,8vw,80px) clamp(18px,4vw,32px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 340px;gap:64px;align-items:start">
<figure id="portrait" data-sticky="1" style="order:2;grid-column:2;margin:0;position:sticky;top:150px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(var(--navy-rgb),.11)"><img src="/assets/dr-chris.webp" alt="Dr. Chris Duhon, AuD" style="display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
<div style="max-width:740px">
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.75;text-wrap:pretty">Dr. Chris Duhon grew up between two worlds - born in Charleston, West Virginia, and raised in the heart of southwest Louisiana, where Cajun culture, good food, and a deep appreciation for family shaped who he is.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">He has carried both of those upbringings with him ever since: the warmth of the South and the joie de vivre of Louisiana run through everything he does, including the way he practices audiology.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">After earning his undergraduate degree in Communication Disorders from the University of Louisiana Lafayette in 1999 and his master's in Audiology from LSU Health Sciences Center in New Orleans in 2003, Dr. Duhon joined the United States Navy - a decision that would take him around the world and define the next two decades of his life.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">He retired in 2025 as a Lieutenant Commander after 20 years of service, bringing his family to College Station, a place that already felt like home, thanks to family ties to Aggieland, a love of the Texas Hill Country, red-dirt music and the pull of a community worth putting down roots in.</p>
<p style="margin:0;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">Liberty Hearing Center is the practice he always wanted to build: a place where patients are treated like neighbors, professionals are given the space to do their best work, and everyone leaves better connected than when they walked in.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:var(--navy);color:var(--border-strong)">
<div data-stack="2" style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(49px,8vw,84px) clamp(18px,4vw,32px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 420px;gap:64px;align-items:start">
<div>
<span style="display:block;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--gold-light);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase">2005 – 2025</span>
<h2 style="margin:0 0 24px;color:var(--white);font-size:clamp(28px,2.5vw,40px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.04em;text-wrap:balance">Military Service</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;max-width:700px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">Dr. Duhon served the United States Navy from 2005 to 2025, working as an audiologist and healthcare leader across a wide range of clinical settings - from military hospitals and specialty clinics to treatment facilities in the U.S. and abroad.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;max-width:700px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">Throughout his career, he cared for active-duty service members, veterans, and military families - conducting diagnostic hearing and balance evaluations, fitting hearing aids, and helping patients maintain the ability to communicate and stay connected to the people around them.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;max-width:700px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">His assignments took him to Pensacola, Florida; Rota, Spain; San Diego, California; Parris Island, South Carolina; and Norfolk, Virginia - each post shaping his clinical perspective and his commitment to serving diverse patient populations.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;max-width:700px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">Dr. Duhon's work extended beyond individual patient care. He supported Department of Defense schools, helping identify children with hearing concerns early so they had the best possible foundation for learning.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;max-width:700px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">He also collaborated with leading researchers in hearing conservation, contributing to advances in hearing protection device fit-testing and noise-induced hearing loss prevention for service members working in high-noise environments.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;max-width:700px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">His military service gave him a firsthand understanding of how hearing loss affects not just communication, but confidence, safety, and quality of life, for service members and their families alike.</p>
<p style="margin:0;max-width:700px;color:var(--white);font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.7;text-wrap:pretty">That understanding is the foundation of every clinical decision he makes at Liberty Hearing Center.</p>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column">
<strong style="margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--gold-light);font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase">Duty stations</strong>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(var(--white-rgb),.16)"><span style="color:var(--gold-light);font-weight:800">—</span><span style="color:var(--white);font-size:17px;font-weight:700">Pensacola, Florida</span></div>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(var(--white-rgb),.16)"><span style="color:var(--gold-light);font-weight:800">—</span><span style="color:var(--white);font-size:17px;font-weight:700">Rota, Spain</span></div>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(var(--white-rgb),.16)"><span style="color:var(--gold-light);font-weight:800">—</span><span style="color:var(--white);font-size:17px;font-weight:700">San Diego, California</span></div>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(var(--white-rgb),.16)"><span style="color:var(--gold-light);font-weight:800">—</span><span style="color:var(--white);font-size:17px;font-weight:700">Parris Island, South Carolina</span></div>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(var(--white-rgb),.16);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(var(--white-rgb),.16)"><span style="color:var(--gold-light);font-weight:800">—</span><span style="color:var(--white);font-size:17px;font-weight:700">Norfolk, Virginia</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:var(--white)">
<div data-stack="2" style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(49px,8vw,84px) clamp(18px,4vw,32px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:340px minmax(0,1fr);gap:64px;align-items:start">
<h2 style="margin:0;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(28px,2.5vw,40px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.04em">Education &amp; Credentials</h2>
<div data-stack="2" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:26px">
<div style="padding:34px 36px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--surface)">
<strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--navy);font-size:20px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.02em">Education</strong>
<ul style="margin:0;padding-left:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7">
<li>Bachelor of Arts, Communication Disorders — University of Louisiana Lafayette (1999)</li>
<li>Master of Science, Audiology — LSU Health Sciences Center, New Orleans (2003)</li>
<li>Doctor of Audiology (AuD) — University of Florida (2007)</li>
<li>Executive Master of Business Administration (EMBA) — Naval Postgraduate School, Monterey (2016)</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div style="padding:34px 36px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--surface)">
<strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--navy);font-size:20px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.02em">Licensure &amp; affiliations</strong>
<ul style="margin:0;padding-left:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7">
<li>Texas Licensed Audiologist</li>
<li>Certificate of Clinical Competence in Audiology (CCC-A) — American Speech-Language-Hearing Association (ASHA)</li>
<li>Member — Texas Academy of Audiology</li>
<li>Retired U.S. Navy Lieutenant Commander — 20 years of service (2005–2025)</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="focus" style="background:var(--white)">
<div data-stack="2" style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(49px,8vw,84px) clamp(18px,4vw,32px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:340px minmax(0,1fr);gap:64px;align-items:start">
<div>
<h2 style="margin:0 0 20px;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(28px,2.5vw,40px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.04em">Areas of Focus</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.75;text-wrap:pretty">Dr. Duhon has been practicing audiology since 2003.</p>
<p style="margin:0;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">Those 23 years of clinical work span military medicine, school-based hearing health, hearing conservation research, and private practice.</p>
</div>
<div id="focus-grid" style="padding:34px 36px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--surface)">
<strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--navy);font-size:20px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.02em">His areas of particular depth include:</strong>
<ul style="margin:0;padding-left:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7">
<li>Adult Hearing Evaluations</li>
<li>Veteran C&amp;P Hearing Evaluations</li>
<li>Hearing Conservation Counseling</li>
<li>School-Based Hearing Screenings</li>
<li>Hearing Aid Fittings with Real-Ear Verification</li>
<li>Pediatric Hearing Evaluation</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:var(--surface-blue)">
<div data-stack="2" style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(49px,8vw,84px) clamp(18px,4vw,32px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:340px minmax(0,1fr);gap:64px;align-items:start">
<h2 style="margin:0;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(28px,2.5vw,40px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.04em;text-wrap:balance">A Little More About Dr. Duhon</h2>
<div style="max-width:740px">
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.75;text-wrap:pretty">He is one of six brothers. He met his best friend — and future wife, Rocio (pronounced Ro-Thee-oh)— while stationed in Rota, Spain, and the two of them have raised two children through a life that has spanned continents. When he is not in the clinic, you will likely find him on the water — boating, fishing, sailing, or swimming — or listening to live music or catching up with family on the weekends.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">His love of Red Dirt music, Shiner Bock, and everything Aggieland made College Station an easy final destination after a career that took him around the world.</p>
<p style="margin:0;color:var(--navy);font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.7;text-wrap:pretty">He is glad to be here. So is his family. And if you ask him, that is exactly how a good story ends.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:var(--white)">
<div data-stack="2" style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(49px,8vw,84px) clamp(18px,4vw,32px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:340px minmax(0,1fr);gap:64px;align-items:start">
<h2 data-sticky="1" style="margin:0;position:sticky;top:150px;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(28px,2.5vw,40px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.04em;text-wrap:balance">Why He Built Liberty Hearing Center</h2>
<div style="max-width:740px">
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.75;text-wrap:pretty">Dr. Duhon founded Liberty Hearing Center to fulfill a goal he had been working toward his entire career: to lead a practice built around two things at once: exceptional patient care and a workplace where the people providing that care actually thrive.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">He wanted to create a place where patients with hearing loss could regain the ability to hear, communicate, and connect with the people they love. Simultaneously, he wanted to build a practice that did not burn out the professionals doing the work, because he believes that a team with time for their own families and their own lives shows up better for their patients.</p>
<p style="margin:0;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">The result is Liberty Hearing Center: a locally owned audiology practice in College Station where everyone who walks through the door is treated like a neighbor, and everyone who works there is treated like family.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
